  /autotrader                          Show command help
  /autotrader enable                   Turn AutoTrader on
  /autotrader disable                  Turn AutoTrader off
  /autotrader status                   Show all current settings

  /autotrader roi <percent>            Minimum ROI required to consider a deal      (default: 5%)
  /autotrader profit <dollars>         Minimum profit required to consider a deal   (default: $100)
  /autotrader maxspend <dollars>       Highest price willing to pay per item        (default: $1,000,000)
  /autotrader ratelimit <ms>           Cooldown before re-considering the same item (default: 5000ms)

  /autotrader markup <percent>         List price as % of true value (ask+profit)   (default: 90%)

  /autotrader blacklist <item name>    Toggle an item on/off the do-not-buy list
  /autotrader blacklist                Show the current blacklist
